            "review_text": "rockie03\nBristol, United Kingdom861 contributions\n0\nlovely the homemade food , serve not great\nFeb 2026 • Solo\nbrilliant place . amazing food and the few cocktails are great , but service sometimes lets it down as they are not great with the English , they misunderstand you and bring the bill when u have asked for the menu .. second rounds are drinks are a bit slow and when children are there for some reason they bring them last when really kids want there stuff first to keep them quite ,, BUT THE FOOD AND THE CHEFS ARE AMAZING , most of the food and pizzas are all handmade and fresh everyday .. I love the place .. its 3 minute walk from my hotel and in 5 days I have been there 3 times ..\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2026",
